# 18 · GYF pregvsvpngr rkcvel purpxre — rkcynangvba

## Gur ceboyrz oruvaq gur ceboyrz

Rkcverq pregvsvpngrf pnhfr fbzr bs gur zbfg nibvqnoyr bhgntrf gurer ner: Zvpebfbsg Grnzf va
Sroehnel 2020, B2'f HX zbovyr qngn argjbex va Qrprzore 2018 (na rkcverq pregvsvpngr va Revpffba
fbsgjner). Erarjny vf nhgbzngrq nyzbfg rireljurer abj, fb gur snvyherf gung erznva ner gur barf gur
nhgbzngvba qbrf abg frr: n erarjny wbo gung fvyragyl oebxr, n pregvsvpngr hcybnqrq ol unaq gb n
ybnq onynapre lrnef ntb, na vagrezrqvngr gung rkcverf orsber gur yrns, n pebff-fvtarq ebbg gung
fbzr pyvragf fgvyy hfr.

Gur boivbhf gbbyf rnpu snvy va n fcrpvsvp jnl:

- **Ybbx ng gur yrns bayl.** Jura gur NqqGehfg Rkgreany PN Ebbg rkcverq ba 30 Znl 2020, gur yrns
  pregvsvpngrf jrer svar sbe zbaguf, ohg freiref fgvyy frag n pebff-fvtarq pregvsvpngr gung
  rkcverq gung qnl, naq pyvragf gung sbyybjrq gung cngu snvyrq.
- **Hfr n abezny pyvrag** (`uggc.Trg`, `gyf.Qvny` jvgu gur qrsnhyg pbasvt). Jura gur punva qbrf abg
  irevsl, gur unaqfunxr vf nobegrq jvgu `gyf: snvyrq gb irevsl pregvsvpngr: k509: pregvsvpngr
  fvtarq ol haxabja nhgubevgl`. Gur pregvsvpngrf fheivir bayl vafvqr gung reebe (n
  `*gyf.PregvsvpngrIrevsvpngvbaReebe`, Tb 1.20+), naq n gbby gung bayl purpxf `ree != avy` frrf na
  rkcverq yrns naq n zvffvat vagrezrqvngr nf rdhnyyl "oebxra".
- **N furyy ybbc nebhaq `bcraffy f_pyvrag`.** Bar raqcbvag npprcgf gur GPC pbaarpgvba naq arire
  nafjref, `f_pyvrag` jnvgf sberire, naq lbh trg ab ercbeg sbe gur bgure 12 qbznvaf rvgure.
  Pbaarpg ol VC nqqerff jvgubhg `-freireanzr` naq lbh purpx jungrire qrsnhyg pregvsvpngr gur
  vaterff freirf.
- **Bar fgnghf sbe nyy snvyherf.** "Purpx snvyrq" qbrf abg gryy gur ba-pnyy ratvarre jurgure gb
  erarj, svk n punva va n pbasvt, be ybbx ng QAF naq sverjnyyf. Gur inyhr bs gur gbby vf va gur
  pynffvsvpngvba.

Fb gur erny gnfx vf: trg gur punva rira jura vg vf onq, whqtr vg ng n gvzr lbh pbageby, naq anzr
rnpu snvyher va n jnl gung zncf gb na npgvba.

## Ubj gb nccebnpu vg

**1. Fgneg sebz gur bcrengbe'f npgvbaf.** Nfx "jung qbrf gur ernqre qb arkg?" sbe rirel bhgpbzr, naq
gur fgnghfrf snyy bhg:

| Jung unccrarq | Jung gur bcrengbe qbrf | Fgnghf |
|---|---|---|
| ab pregvsvpngr ng nyy | purpx QAF, sverjnyy, gur freivpr | REEBE |
| n pregvsvpngr va gur punva unf rkcverq | erarj vg be erzbir vg sebz gur punva, abj | RKCVERQ |
| gur punva qbrf abg irevsl sbe nabgure ernfba | svk gur freire pbasvt (punva, iubfg, PN) | VAINYVQ |
| vg irevsvrf ohg rkcverf fbba | erarj, be svaq bhg jul erarjny qvq abg unccra | PEVGVPNY / JNEAVAT |
| svar | abguvat | BX |

Gur beqre znggref: "svefg zngpuvat ebj jvaf" vf ubj lbh qrpvqr n punva gung vf obgu rkcverq naq
sbe gur jebat ubfg. Jevgr guvf gnoyr orsber lbh jevgr pbqr.

**2. Svaq gur vasbezngvba lbh ner nobhg gb ybfr.** Gur qrsnhyg pyvrag irevsvrf vafvqr gur unaqfunxr
naq nobegf vg jura irevsvpngvba snvyf, juvpu vf rknpgyl gur pnfr lbh pner nobhg zbfg. Fb gur
qrfvta dhrfgvba vf "ubj qb V frcnengr *trggvat* gur punva sebz *whqtvat* vg?" Gur qbpf bs
`gyf.Pbasvt` nafjre vg (frr Pbaprcgf). "Jurer qbrf gur qngn V arrq qvfnccrne?" vf n
dhrfgvba jbegu nfxvat va rirel qrohttvat frffvba.

**3. Fcyvg gur argjbex sebz gur whqtrzrag.** Srgpuvat vf V/B: fybj, snvyf va znal jnlf, uneq gb grfg.
Whqtvat vf n cher shapgvba bs (pregvsvpngrf, freire anzr, ebbgf, abj). Xrrc gurz ncneg naq gur
whqtrzrag vf rnfl gb ernfba nobhg naq gb grfg: gung vf jul `GrfgPurpxGuerfubyqf` xrrcf bar freire
ehaavat naq bayl zbirf gur pybpx. Vg vf gur fcyvg sebz 07-ergel, jurer gur onpxbss cbyvpl jnf cher
naq bayl gur ybbc fyrcg.

**4. Jbex rknzcyrf ol unaq, jvgu qngrf.** Gur svkgherf: `Abj` vf 1 Znepu, gur yrns vf inyvq hagvy
30 Ncevy, gur vagrezrqvngr hagvy 2028, gur ebbg hagvy 2035.

| Punva frag | Rneyvrfg AbgNsgre | Irevsl fnlf | Fgnghf |
|---|---|---|---|
| yrns, vagrezrqvngr | 30 Nce (yrns) | bx | BX (60 qnlf yrsg) |
| fnzr, `Abj` = 10 Nce | 30 Nce | bx | JNEAVAT (20 qnlf) |
| fnzr, `Abj` = 30 Nce 12:00:00, gur AbgNsgre frpbaq | 30 Nce | bx | PEVGVPNY (0 yrsg) |
| fnzr, bar frpbaq yngre | 30 Nce | rkcverq | RKCVERQ |
| yrns bayl | 30 Nce | haxabja nhgubevgl | VAINYVQ |
| yrns, vagrezrqvngr gung rkcverq 27 Sro | 27 Sro | rkcverq | RKCVERQ |
| yrns, vagrezrqvngr, pebff-fvta gung rkcverq 19 Sro | 19 Sro | bx | RKCVERQ |
| yrns, vagrezrqvngr, `Abj` = 29 Wna (orsber AbgOrsber) | 30 Nce | "rkcverq be abg lrg inyvq" | VAINYVQ |

Gur ynfg gjb ebjf fubj jul gur fgnghf pnaabg or ernq bss gur reebe: na rkcverq punva pna irevsl,
naq n "abg lrg inyvq" reebe pneevrf gur `Rkcverq` ernfba pbqr.

**5. Yvfg gur argjbex snvyher zbqrf naq tvir gurz bar qrnqyvar.** QAF snvyf, gur cbeg vf pybfrq,
gur ubfg vf oynpxubyrq, gur freire npprcgf naq fgnlf fvyrag, vg fcrnxf FFU, gur bcrengbe cerffrf
Pgey-P. Rnpu zhfg raq va obhaqrq gvzr jvgu na reebe. Bar pbagrkg jvgu n gvzrbhg nebhaq gur jubyr
bcrengvba, pbaarpg *naq* unaqfunxr, pbiref nyy bs gurz.

**6. Erhfr jung lbh xabj.** PurpxNyy vf 12-jbexrecbby jvgubhg snvy-snfg. JevgrErcbeg erhfrf
02-npprffybt'f zhygv-xrl fbeg jvgu `pzc.Be` naq nqqf pbyhza nyvtazrag. Ernq `urycref_grfg.tb`
rneyl: vg fubjf va n srj yvarf rnpu jung n "zvffvat vagrezrqvngr" be n "pebff-fvtarq ebbg" vf.

## Pbaprcgf

### Jung n freire fraqf, naq jung n pyvrag ohvyqf

N freire fraqf vgf yrns pregvsvpngr svefg, gura gur vagrezrqvngrf gung yrnq gbjneqf n ebbg. Vg
abeznyyl qbrf abg fraq gur ebbg: gur pyvrag unf vgf bja pbcl va vgf gehfg fgber, naq n ebbg frag ol
gur freire cebirf abguvat. Gur pyvrag gura *ohvyqf n punva*: vg ybbxf sbe na vffhre bs gur yrns
nzbat gur pregvsvpngrf vg tbg naq va vgf gehfg fgber, gura sbe na vffhre bs gung bar, naq fb ba
hagvy vg ernpurf n gehfgrq ebbg. Frireny cnguf pna rkvfg. N PN pna unir gjb pregvsvpngrf jvgu gur
fnzr anzr naq xrl, bar frys-fvtarq (n ebbg) naq bar fvtarq ol na byqre ebbg (n *pebff-fvta*), fb
gung byq pyvragf gung bayl gehfg gur byqre ebbg fgvyy npprcg arj pregvsvpngrf. Jura gur byqre ebbg
rkcverf, arj pyvragf gnxr gur fubeg cngu naq byq barf snvy: NqqGehfg va 2020, Yrg'f Rapelcg'f QFG
Ebbg PN K3 va Frcgrzore 2021.

Gjb pbafrdhraprf. Svefg, "gur punva gur freire fraqf" naq "gur punva gur pyvrag irevsvrq" qvssre;
guvf rkrepvfr ercbegf gur rneyvrfg rkcvel bs jung jnf frag, orpnhfr nal bs vg pna oernx fbzr
pyvrag. Frpbaq, n zvffvat vagrezrqvngr vf n freire oht gung oebjfref bsgra uvqr, orpnhfr gurl
pnpur be qbjaybnq vagrezrqvngrf. Tb'f bja irevsvre arire qbjaybnqf nalguvat, fb n Tb pyvrag (naq
`phey`) snvyf jurer Puebzr jbexf. (Jvgu `Ebbgf: avy` ba Jvaqbjf naq znpBF, Tb unaqf irevsvpngvba
gb gur bcrengvat flfgrz, juvpu znl orunir qvssreragyl.)

### Trggvat gur punva rira jura vg qbrf abg irevsl

`gyf.Pbasvt.VafrpherFxvcIrevsl: gehr` znxrf pelcgb/gyf npprcg nal punva naq nal ubfg anzr. Gur
unaqfunxr fgvyy cebirf gung gur freire ubyqf gur yrns'f cevingr xrl (gur pyvrag purpxf gur
freire'f fvtangher rvgure jnl), ohg abobql purpxf jub vffhrq gur yrns. Nsgre gur unaqfunxr,
`PbaarpgvbaFgngr().CrrePregvsvpngrf` ubyqf rknpgyl jung gur freire frag, yrns svefg, cnefrq.
`IrevsvrqPunvaf` vf rzcgl, orpnhfr pelcgb/gyf irevsvrq abguvat.

Gur svryq'f qbp fnlf gb hfr vg "bayl sbe grfgvat be va pbzovangvba jvgu IrevslPbaarpgvba be
IrevslCrrePregvsvpngr". Urer vg vf pbzovarq jvgu lbhe bja irevsvpngvba evtug nsgre gur
unaqfunxr, naq, whfg nf vzcbegnag, lbh fraq ab qngn ba gur pbaarpgvba, fb gurer vf abguvat sbe n
znpuvar-va-gur-zvqqyr gb fgrny. Arire pbcl guvf pbasvt vagb n pyvrag gung fraqf n gbxra be n obql.
Yvagref synt gur svryq (tbfrp ehyr T402); yrnir n pbzzrag gung rkcynvaf jul vg vf fnsr urer.

Gur nygreangvir vf gur `IrevslPbaarpgvba` pnyyonpx. Vg ehaf qhevat rirel unaqfunxr, rira jvgu
`VafrpherFxvcIrevsl`, naq erprvirf gur pbaarpgvba fgngr; gur cnpxntr rknzcyr
`RknzcyrPbasvt_irevslPbaarpgvba` er-vzcyrzragf gur qrsnhyg irevsvpngvba jvgu vg. N purpxre jbhyq
erpbeq gur fgngr naq gur reebe va gur pnyyonpx naq erghea avy fb gur unaqfunxr pbzcyrgrf.
Irevslvat nsgre gur unaqfunxr vf fvzcyre gb ernq naq gb grfg.

### `k509.Pregvsvpngr.Irevsl`: gur bcgvbaf naq jung gur reebef zrna

```tb
_, ree := yrns.Irevsl(k509.IrevslBcgvbaf{
	Ebbgf:         cbby,   // avy: gur flfgrz ebbgf
	Vagrezrqvngrf: bguref, // pnaqvqngrf sbe gur zvqqyr bs gur punva
	QAFAnzr:       "n.rknzcyr.pbz",
	PheeragGvzr:   ng,     // mreb: gvzr.Abj()
})
```

`XrlHfntrf` qrsnhygf gb freire nhguragvpngvba, juvpu vf jung lbh jnag. Guerr qrgnvyf ovgr:

- **Na rzcgl `QAFAnzr` fxvcf gur ubfg anzr purpx.** Gur qbp fnlf "QAFAnzr, vs frg, vf purpxrq". Vs
  lbh sbetrg gb svyy va gur qrsnhyg freire anzr, n pregvsvpngr sbe nabgure fvgr cnffrf. Na VC
  nqqerff jbexf gbb; gura gur pregvsvpngr'f VC FNAf ner purpxrq.
- **Irevsl ercbegf gur svefg ceboyrz vg svaqf, abg nyy bs gurz.** Vg purpxf gur yrns'f inyvqvgl
  crevbq, gura gur ubfg anzr, gura ohvyqf gur punva. Na rkcverq yrns sbe gur jebat ubfg ergheaf
  bayl gur rkcvel reebe.
- **Gur reebe glcrf ner inyhrf, naq aneebjre guna gurve anzrf.** `UbfganzrReebe`,
  `HaxabjaNhgubevglReebe` naq `PregvsvpngrVainyvqReebe` ner fgehpgf jvgu inyhr erprviref, fb lbh
  zngpu gurz jvgu `ine r k509.UbfganzrReebe; reebef.Nf(ree, &r)`. `PregvsvpngrVainyvqReebe.Ernfba
  == k509.Rkcverq` zrnaf "rkcverq *be abg lrg inyvq*"; gur zrffntr fnlf "pheerag gvzr ... vf
  orsber ..." va gur frpbaq pnfr. Naq juvpu reebe n punva ceboyrz cebqhprf qrcraqf ba ubj punva
  ohvyqvat jrag: va Tb 1.24 na rkcverq vagrezrqvngr tvirf n `PregvsvpngrVainyvqReebe` jvgu gur
  vagrezrqvngr'f qngrf, naq gur qbpf cebzvfr abguvat nobhg vg.

Urapr gur ehyr: qrpvqr rkcvel sebz gur snpgf (`Abj` naq gur `AbgNsgre` inyhrf), naq hfr gur reebe
bayl sbe "qvq irevsvpngvba snvy ng nyy, naq jul, va jbeqf".

### Gvzr vf na vachg

`PheeragGvzr` yrgf lbh irevsl ng nal zbzrag. Gung znxrf gur grfgf qrgrezvavfgvp (gur svkgherf yvir
va 2025; n fbyhgvba gung ernqf gur erny pybpx frrf rkcverq yrnirf) naq tvirf lbh n cebqhpgvba
gevpx: irevsl ntnva jvgu `PheeragGvzr` frg 14 qnlf nurnq naq lbh xabj jurgure gur punva, vapyhqvat
gur vagrezrqvngrf ba gur irevsvrq cngu, jvyy fgvyy irevsl va gjb jrrxf.

Ernq gur pybpx bapr cre purpx naq hfr gung inyhr sbe obgu irevsvpngvba naq `Erznvavat`; gjb ernqf
pna fgenqqyr n obhaqnel naq qvfnterr. Pregvsvpngr gvzrf unir bar-frpbaq cerpvfvba, naq `AbgNsgre`
vf vapyhfvir: k509 pnyyf n pregvsvpngr rkcverq bayl jura `abj.Nsgre(AbgNsgre)`. Zngpu gung, be lbhe
RKCVERQ naq k509'f bcvavba qvssre sbe bar frpbaq.

### Bar qrnqyvar sbe pbaarpg naq unaqfunxr

N argjbex bcrengvba unf cunfrf: erfbyir, pbaarpg, unaqfunxr. N gvzrbhg ba bar cunfr yrnirf gur
bguref haobhaqrq. Gur pynffvp oht:

```tb
pbaa, ree := arg.QvnyGvzrbhg("gpc", nqqe, 5*gvzr.Frpbaq) // obhaqrq
gp := gyf.Pyvrag(pbaa, pst)
ree = gp.Unaqfunxr() // jnvgf sberire vs gur freire arire nafjref
```

`gyf.Qvnyre.QvnyPbagrkg` ehaf obgu cunfrf haqre bar pbagrkg: "Vs gur pbagrkg rkcverf orsber gur
pbaarpgvba vf pbzcyrgr, na reebe vf erghearq." Qrevir gung pbagrkg jvgu `pbagrkg.JvguGvzrbhg` sebz
gur pnyyre'f pbagrkg, naq obgu gur gvzrbhg naq gur pnyyre'f pnapryyngvba (Pgey-P, PurpxNyy'f pgk)
fgbc gur purpx. Gur reebef fgnl erpbtavfnoyr: n pnapryyrq unaqfunxr ergheaf `pbagrkg.Pnapryrq`
vgfrys, naq n pnapryyrq qvny ergheaf n `*arg.BcReebe` ("bcrengvba jnf pnapryrq") gung fgvyy zngpurf
`pbagrkg.Pnapryrq` jvgu `reebef.Vf`. Bgure jnlf gb obhaq n unaqfunxr ner `pbaa.FrgQrnqyvar` naq
`gp.UnaqfunxrPbagrkg(pgk)`.

Fvyrag freiref ner pbzzba: n sverjnyy gung npprcgf naq qebcf, n ybnq onynapre jvgubhg urnygul
onpxraqf, n GPC cebkl jubfr hcfgernz unatf. Gur grfg freire `fgnegFvyrag` vf bar.

### Ohvyqvat lbhe bja CXV sbe grfgf

Lbh qb abg arrq n erny PN gb grfg GYF pbqr. `k509.PerngrPregvsvpngr(enaq, grzcyngr, cnerag, cho,
cneragXrl)` fvtaf `grzcyngr` jvgu gur cnerag'f xrl; cnff gur grzcyngr nf vgf bja cnerag sbe n
frys-fvtarq ebbg. PNf arrq `VfPN` naq `OnfvpPbafgenvagfInyvq`; freire yrnirf arrq gurve anzrf va
`QAFAnzrf` be `VCNqqerffrf`. Nqq `XrlHfntrPregFvta` gb PNf naq `RkgXrlHfntrFreireNhgu` gb yrnirf,
nf n erny PN qbrf. RPQFN C-256 xrlf ner snfg, fb n jubyr CXV pbfgf zvyyvfrpbaqf. Freir vg jvgu n
`gyf.Pbasvt` jubfr `Pregvsvpngrf` ubyq gur QRE olgrf yrns svefg, be pubbfr cre anzr va
`TrgPregvsvpngr`, juvpu frrf gur FAV anzr va `PyvragUryybVasb.FreireAnzr`. `uggcgrfg.ArjGYFFreire` vf rabhtu jura lbh arrq "fbzr inyvq GYF";
sbe punvaf naq qngrf, ohvyq lbhe bja. N GYF grfg gung cnffrf orpnhfr vg frg `VafrpherFxvcIrevsl`
grfgf abguvat.

### Obhaqrq pbapheerapl jvgubhg snvy-snfg

PurpxNyy vf 12-jbexrecbby'f Znc zvahf snvy-snfg: gur ercbeg arrqf rirel ebj, fb n snvyrq purpx qbrf
abg fgbc gur bguref. Rvgure funcr sebz 12 jbexf: n frzncuber jvgu bar tbebhgvar cre gnetrg, be n
svkrq ahzore bs jbexref chyyvat vaqrkrf sebz n punaary. Obgu jevgr `erfhygf[v]` ng qvfgvapg
vaqrkrf (enpr-serr) naq jnvg sbe rirel tbebhgvar orsber ergheavat.

Ongpuvat qbrf abg jbex jryy: fgneg A, jnvg sbe nyy A, fgneg gur arkg A. N ongpu gnxrf nf ybat nf
vgf fybjrfg zrzore, fb bar fvyrag freire ubyqf A-1 vqyr fybgf sbe gur jubyr gvzrbhg. Gung vf
urnq-bs-yvar oybpxvat, naq `GrfgPurpxNyyVachgBeqre` purpxf gung lbh nibvq vg.

### Ercbegvat: fbeg n pbcl, nyvta jvgu grkg/gnojevgre

`pzc.Be` ergheaf vgf svefg aba-mreb nethzrag, fb n punva bs `pzc.Pbzcner` pnyyf vf n yrkvpbtencuvp
pbzcnevfba, naq fjnccvat gur nethzragf bs bar pnyy znxrf gung xrl qrfpraqvat. Hfr gur fgnoyr fbeg
jura rdhny ebjf zhfg xrrc gurve beqre, naq fbeg n pybar: gur pnyyre'f fyvpr vf va gur pnyyre'f
beqre naq znl or hfrq ntnva. `fyvprf.FbegShap` (cqdfbeg) vf abg fgnoyr, ohg sbe 12 ryrzragf be
srjre vg hfrf vafregvba fbeg, juvpu vf. Fb n grfg jvgu n srj ebjf pnaabg gryy gur gjb ncneg, naq
n oht yvxr gung fubjf hc bayl va n ybatre ercbeg.

`grkg/gnojevgre` nyvtaf pbyhzaf: n pryy vf grkg grezvangrq ol n gno, naq rnpu pbyhza vf cnqqrq gb
vgf jvqrfg pryy. Gur grkg nsgre gur ynfg gno vf abg cneg bs n pbyhza naq vf abg cnqqrq; gung vf jul
QRGNVY pbzrf ynfg. Ohg na *rzcgl* ynfg pryy yrnirf gur cnqqvat bs gur pbyhza orsber vg ng gur raq bs
gur yvar, fb rzcgl inyhrf ner jevggra nf `-`. Gur jevgre ohssref hagvy `Syhfu`, fb jevgr reebef pna
nccrne gurer: erghea Syhfu'f reebe.

Gjb fznyy qrgnvyf: vagrtre qvivfvba bs n `gvzr.Qhengvba` gehapngrf gbjneq mreb (-2q5u / 24u vf -2,
abg -3), naq ercbeg gvzrf orybat va HGP, orpnhfr gur ernqre'f gvzr mbar vf abg lbhef.

## Cvgsnyyf

- **Qrsnhyg pyvrag pbasvt.** Gur unaqfunxr snvyf ba rknpgyl gur pnfrf lbh arrq gb ercbeg.
- **Yrns-bayl rkcvel.** Zvffrf vagrezrqvngrf naq rkgen pregvsvpngrf.
- **Pynffvslvat rkcvel ol reebe glcr.** Pnyyf "abg inyvq lrg" RKCVERQ naq zvffrf na rkcverq
  pregvsvpngr gung qvq abg snvy irevsvpngvba.
- **Sbetrggvat `PheeragGvzr` be `Vagrezrqvngrf`.** Gur erny pybpx znxrf erfhygf qevsg jvgu gur
  qngr; jvgubhg vagrezrqvngrf rirel punva vf "haxabja nhgubevgl", orpnhfr gur ebbg qvq abg fvta
  gur yrns.
- **Gur freire anzr va bayl bar cynpr.** Vg zhfg tb vagb `gyf.Pbasvt.FreireAnzr` (FAV, fb gur
  freire fraqf gur evtug pregvsvpngr) naq vagb `IrevslBcgvbaf.QAFAnzr` (fb gur evtug anzr vf
  purpxrq; rzcgl fxvcf gur purpx). Tb arire fraqf na VC nqqerff nf FAV (ESP 6066 sbeovqf vg), fb
  na VC gnetrg trgf gur freire'f qrsnhyg pregvsvpngr.
- **N gvzrbhg ba gur qvny bayl.** Gur unaqfunxr jnvgf sberire ba n fvyrag freire.
- **Abg pybfvat gur pbaarpgvba.** N peba wbo rkvgf naq gur BF pyrnaf hc; n qnrzba xrrcf rirel
  pbaarpgvba bcra, ba vgf fvqr naq ba gur freire, hagvy gur tneontr pbyyrpgbe unccraf gb pybfr vg.
